"""Matrixen Material Intelligence — accessible light-theme Dash workspace.

The application deliberately keeps analytical/business logic in the existing
backend modules. This file is the presentation and interaction layer.

Design goals
------------
* Light, calm, high-contrast interface with restrained glassmorphism.
* Natural gradients, halftone dots, and abstract line-art used as atmosphere,
  never as decoration that competes with data.
* Lucid information hierarchy: explain first, act second, inspect third.
* Responsive layouts that remain usable on laptops, tablets, and phones.
* Team/About information is intentionally non-blocking and separate from the
  analytical workflows.
* Existing Matrixen capabilities remain intact: source search, pair matching,
  NMC lookup, governance queue, and data-quality inspection.
"""

